                        <h2 class="section-heading text-uppercase mb-4">Mel Eaton</h2>
                        <p>I'm Mel Eaton — muralist, designer, and the person behind every Off The Wall project from first brief to final brushstroke.</p>
                        <p>I've been painting walls professionally for over a decade, with more than 1,000m² of murals across New Zealand — from small feature walls in local hospitality venues to large-scale public works. Before that, and running alongside it, I'm a brand and graphic designer. That combination is what makes the work different: I don't just paint what you describe, I design something that actually reflects your brand and tells your story.</p>
                        <p>For more on my design practice, visit <a href="https://meleaton.design" target="_blank">meleaton.design</a>.</p>
                    </div>
